WEBVTT

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.290
"Majima Produce"

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:14.540
"Majima Produce"

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:14.540
"This is a work of fiction. The characters,
organizations, and names herein are fictitious,
and bear no relation to existing entities."

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:16.500
"This is a work of fiction. The characters,
organizations, and names herein are fictitious,
and bear no relation to existing entities."

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:21.040
Big Rei, sorry to have you look into
something so troublesome.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:22.830
And so?

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:25.950
This phone call never happened, okay?

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:30.200
There's no record whatsoever of Shadow
himself in the central supercomputer.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:36.250
Just long-standing rumors amongst
the police about his existence.

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:40.830
Amongst those rumors, there's just
one claim that seems highly credible.

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:43.080
Shadow is not a group.

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:46.660
He's just one person.

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:47.910
One person?

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:53.410
Makoto, reports are coming in from the
Juvenile and Community Safety divisions.

00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:55.790
Sounds like more and more trouble's brewing?

00:00:55.790 --> 00:00:58.660
Y-Yeah, I guess.

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:01.120
Make sure you don't do anything dangerous.

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:04.080
I know, I'll be careful.

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:07.870
Sure. I'll be in touch.

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:09.000
Everyone's so worried about me...

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.870
"Takashi"

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.870
Everyone's so worried about me...

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:13.870
What am I, a little boy?

00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:18.000
"Majima Produce"

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:19.330
The phone you have called
is either outside its service area,

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:21.250
--or its power is turned off.
Your call could not be completed.

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:23.410
--What, again?
--or its power is turned off.
Your call could not be completed.

00:01:34.910 --> 00:01:37.250
"Ikebukuro West Gate Park"

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:56.700
"Griffith Rental"

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:58.330
"Griffith Rental"

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:58.330
Okay, cut!

00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:00.370
"Griffith Rental"

00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:00.370
Break time!

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:01.830
It was like a total sneak attack.

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:04.290
Are you kidding me?

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:05.410
Director.

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:07.450
Are you filming the making-of again?

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:09.330
I mean, we're on break.

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:12.370
Why not? It's once in a lifetime.

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:13.410
Director.

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:14.910
Please check on this.

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:16.330
Will do!

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:17.540
Oh.

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:20.450
Makoto-san, that scene earlier was great!

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:22.370
You keep getting better and better.

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:24.580
Oh, thanks a lot.

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:26.500
Let's go out for drinks sometime.

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:28.330
Sure, sometime.

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:33.330
--The phone you have called
is either outside its service area...

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:37.660
"Takashi"

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:37.660
--Back to not answering...
--The phone you have called
is either outside its service area...

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:38.870
Makoto-san.

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:40.370
King isn't picking up?

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:41.410
Yeah.

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:43.500
It figures...

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:46.290
Did you pass the word along to Hiroto?

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:47.750
Yes.

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:52.160
But he said, "It doesn't matter
if Shadow is one person or a group."

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:56.580
Listen, call him again and tell him,
"Shadow operates alone.

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:59.540
The ones attacking your teams aren't Shadow.

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:03.250
Until we know who the real culprit is,
don't do anything rash."

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:04.450
All right.

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:09.750
Hello, this is Crow. Put me on with Hiroto-san.

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:14.120
Hiroto <i>could </i>just talk to me directly.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:16.250
Does he think he's King already?

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:18.750
"Makoto"
"Decline" "Answer"

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:19.080
"Makoto"

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:20.580
Hello.

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:23.620
Hey, it's me. Did you find out anything?

00:04:23.620 --> 00:04:26.080
Oh, this is good!

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:27.120
Otoko <i>Purin</i>--pudding for real men.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:28.830
"Otoko <i>Purin</i>"

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:28.830
Otoko <i>Purin</i>--pudding for real men.

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:31.910
You should try some. I recommend it.

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:34.950
So?

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:40.120
I found out what people hired Shadow.

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:42.750
"People"? As in an organization?!

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:43.200
"Mars Enterprises"

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:43.200
"People"? As in an organization?!

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:46.540
"Mars Enterprises"

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:46.540
That's right. Northern Kanto's Maruken Sougyou,

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:50.870
"Mars Enterprises"

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:50.870
and its front company, Mars Enterprises.

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:54.750
"Mars Enterprises"

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:54.750
Looks like they plan on expanding into Ikebukuro.

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:57.910
Seems not long ago,
Mars got into a dispute with Donglong

00:04:57.910 --> 00:05:01.870
over sex industry turf,
and headhunting each other's women.

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:03.250
Donglong, huh?

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:07.160
Weren't the guys who got jumped
at the Chinese place yesterday Donglong?

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:08.500
That's right.

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:11.120
I don't really get this, though.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:12.160
Get what?

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:14.410
I got ahold of some reliable info.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:17.080
Shadow is one person, not a group.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:19.250
Oh, is that so?

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:24.700
But the group of perps attacking Hiroto's
teams are going by the name "Shadow."

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:27.080
Why?

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:30.370
There's a chance Mars
is behind those attacks, too.

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:34.540
It's like I said the other day.
It's all about balance.

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:36.750
To expand into Ikebukuro,

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:40.040
it's necessary to cause problems here
and there for the Hidaka Group.

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:45.290
To demolish the town's balance and sow chaos.

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:50.410
"Makoto"

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:50.410
And in that case, Mars' plan
is proceeding smoothly.

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:54.580
Gotcha. Now I know what
the true culprit is after.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:56.250
You're a big help, Saru.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:59.450
I saw to it Takashi received
the same information.

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:00.830
See ya.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.580
So, you'll answer <i>Saru's </i>calls?

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:09.080
Don't move.

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:11.700
Makoto Majima.

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:13.750
Do you know who I am?

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:15.080
No.

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:17.750
I'm someone with a grudge against you guys.

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:22.330
Crushing the G-Boys isn't
just some yakuza turf war.

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:26.910
My true goal is to seize power from you guys.

00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:33.330
Well, aren't <i>you </i>a fool.
The G-Boys won't be so easy to cr--

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:36.200
I'll save my revenge for last.

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:50.330
"Griffith Rental"

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:55.410
Makoto. Makoto!

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:58.000
Are you all right, Makoto-san?

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:01.620
Don't just sleep, we're in
a hurry to get through filming.

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:05.000
At this rate, we won't get to finish
before the day the store closes.

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:08.950
I was attacked by Rabbit Mask.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:10.750
Rabbit Mask?

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:13.620
That kind of sounds like usable material.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:17.950
Toshiaki! Is that camera running?

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:20.580
Yeah, I think it's recording.

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:26.290
Okay, tell me when you're done.

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:28.160
Sure. Thanks.

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:32.330
If this works, we'll know
who Rabbit Mask really is.

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:36.950
Good call, Makoto-san. I knew you
were great at more than just acting.

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:39.870
"Volume"

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:42.540
"Volume"

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:42.540
I'm someone with a grudge against you guys.

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:47.160
Crushing the G-Boys isn't
just some yakuza turf war.

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:52.830
My true goal is to seize power from you guys.

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:55.660
I'll save my revenge for last.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.870
I'll save my revenge for last.

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:03.660
I'll save my revenge for last.

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:07.040
That voice...

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:08.500
It's him!

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:12.700
Yamamoto! You've come back to Ikebukuro.

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:15.250
Crow! I want to talk to Hiroto right away!

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:17.000
R-Right.

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:18.200
"Hiroto"

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:21.290
Hiroto! It's me, Makoto!

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:22.790
What is it?

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:27.080
The ones attacking your teams are the
gang of five from the OK Holdings case.

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:30.250
And operating behind them is Mars Enterprises.

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:33.200
Takashi isn't involved!

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:36.370
I'll get even with them at some point, too.

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:39.120
Listen, we know who the real culprits are!

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:41.250
Now there's no reason to go to war!

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:43.500
Get 'em!

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:44.450
For Knight!

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:45.870
--That's right!
--Crush Takashi!

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:48.750
Takashi and I are fated to fight.

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.370
Hiroto! Wait!

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:55.540
There was friction and hatred
between us from the start.

00:08:57.160 --> 00:09:00.040
It's finally here! War!

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:02.500
War!

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:07.000
Crow! Go and stop Hiroto for now!

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:08.870
It's gotten way beyond me!

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:11.410
Then at least buy some time! Go!

00:09:11.410 --> 00:09:12.950
O-Okay!

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:19.660
Takashi, pick up!

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:21.910
Makoto?

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:23.870
What is it?

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:26.330
I told you, pick up when I call!

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:30.040
You didn't say pick up right away.

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:31.250
Where are you right now?

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:33.750
"Mars Enterprises"

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:35.250
"Mars Enterprises"

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:37.290
"Mars Enterprises"

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:37.290
Look at that.

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:42.330
Your story is probably correct,
but that down there doesn't add up.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:44.830
That's the Mars office.

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:47.330
Suddenly, it's not so easy to get in or out.

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:50.620
They sure are on the lookout for something.

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:55.040
If Saru is right, and everything's
going fine, what's that all about?

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:57.200
It looks like they're afraid of something.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:00.540
Yeah, it doesn't make sense.

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:03.950
There's one piece missing from your explanation.

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:05.870
The Red Angels.

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:10.620
No way! They should stay put
unless someone makes a move against them!

00:10:10.620 --> 00:10:14.200
They could take advantage of
the G-Boys quarrel and come attack.

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:17.450
Hey! What're <i>you </i>saying, now?!

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:19.700
I want to avoid a war, too.

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:24.950
But in this world, there are things
you can stop, and things you cannot.

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:28.250
So, you're going to be in a movie?

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:30.120
I heard your acting is terrible.

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:32.200
Why bring that up now?

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:38.750
The reason your acting is bad is that
you typically pretend to be a nice guy.

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:09.500
Makoto Majima.

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:12.080
Shadow?

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:14.660
There are those who call me that.

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:16.580
What do you want?

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:18.830
I came to this town to do a job.

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:25.830
But I heard a rumor about a troubleshooter
who works for justice, not money.

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:29.580
This piqued my interest,
so I tailed you for a bit.

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:34.790
You certainly are interesting.
Not much of an actor, though.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:37.370
Was it Mars that hired you?

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:42.500
Yes. Along with those masked
jokers at the same time.

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:46.290
Seems they want some chaos in this town.

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:51.620
However, Mars and the kids saw fit
to make indiscreet use of my name.

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:55.500
When it comes to working alone
and racking up lots of good results,

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:58.500
reputation is paramount.

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:01.620
Yeah, I understand that.

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:05.200
The only job I actually did was
the one at the Chinese restaurant.

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:09.330
Neatly, and flawlessly, like I always have.

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:13.540
But the jobs the kids did were a mess.

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:16.410
In other words, your reputation took a hit.

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:21.950
That's right, that reputation that's
paramount for the self-employed.

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:25.830
Naturally, they deserve some penalty.

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:29.500
Did you maybe go beat up some of the Mars guys?

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:35.290
Several executives. Everyone who has
"board member" on his business card.

00:12:37.870 --> 00:12:42.700
But, that still leaves the masked bunch.

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:49.290
I hear you're an expert at finding people.

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:51.870
I'm not all <i>that </i>good.

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:56.330
If you track them down...

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:58.250
...I'll get rid of them.

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:03.200
All right.

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:10.620
In return, there's one other person
I want you to give a penalty to.

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:12.250
Because...

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:15.450
...he's our weak point.

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:18.950
"Episode 7"

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:21.330
"Majima Produce"

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:29.200
Did something happen?

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:31.830
I was about to ask you that.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:34.870
Hiroto got jumped last night.

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:39.370
Who the hell're you?!

00:13:56.910 --> 00:13:58.910
His left knee is a mess,

00:13:58.910 --> 00:14:02.500
and it won't be easy for him
to leave the hospital for a while.

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:04.830
There are all kinds of rumors flying around,

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:07.910
but I was at a G-Boys
gathering when it happened.

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:09.700
Okay.

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:14.660
Makoto, sometimes you go rushing
ahead, consequences be damned.

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:18.330
I did what I had to do. I can't stand war.

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:21.250
Besides, if he gets taken down,

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:25.080
the Hiroto Faction should
think the gang of five did it.

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:29.700
I spread the rumor that those five
are working for Mars, not you.

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:32.160
That wraps up this whole mess.

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:35.080
All right.

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:42.080
"Nice guy," my ass!

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:45.700
"Majima Produce"

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:52.790
Hello.

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:54.830
Oh, Crow. What's up?

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:57.790
Makoto-san, did you hear
what happened with Hiroto-san?

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:00.700
Yeah. That's unfortunate, what happened to him,

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:02.750
but now his fighters will settle down.

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:04.410
There's a problem with that!

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:07.330
"Kamihigashi Industries"

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:07.330
They're talking about
launching an all-out attack,

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:09.830
and getting revenge for Hiroto-san!

00:15:09.830 --> 00:15:11.370
What's up with that?!

00:15:11.370 --> 00:15:15.080
They must know it was
those five guys Mars hired!

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:19.200
I told them that. But nobody wants to listen.

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:22.000
They're convinced King is behind it.

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:25.500
Now I can't hold them back by myself.
Makoto-san, please help!

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:27.410
Move it!

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:28.450
"Makoto"

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:28.450
Crow!

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:32.080
Hey, Crow!

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:35.160
"Majima Produce"

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:38.330
Pick up! Pick up! Pick up!

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:40.750
Hello! Takashi?!

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:52.250
Takashi knows about the situation.

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:54.580
And?

00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:59.870
As head of the G-Boys,
he needs to quell this disturbance.

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:02.370
He's prepared to go to war, if he must.

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:08.620
What's going on has nothing
to do with you Red Angels.

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:10.410
I realize that!

00:16:10.410 --> 00:16:13.540
But I want you to help out.

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:16.250
No sparks have come flying yet.

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:19.950
I'm not going to have my guys
shed their blood for no reason.

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:23.410
All I want to do is prevent the war.

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:26.660
If we show up, blood will flow.

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:28.540
I have a plan.

00:16:28.540 --> 00:16:32.500
A plan where, maybe things
will end without bloodshed.

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:39.540
Takashi!

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:41.790
It's time for Knight to be avenged.

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:45.290
Come on. We're ready for you.

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:49.870
Stop! Stop!

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:51.620
What're <i>you </i>guys here for?!

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:54.160
This doesn't concern you! Butt out!

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:58.410
We're siding with King.

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:01.660
What?! You wanna throw down?!

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:04.120
Say somethin', dammit!

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:06.410
What the hell is this shit about?!

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:12.660
You see, I like this place.

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:15.370
Ikebukuro sure is a peaceful town.

00:17:15.370 --> 00:17:20.290
The reason it stays that way
is that my pal is around.

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:22.660
If you try anything against King,

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:26.450
you'll make an enemy of us Red Angels.

00:17:26.450 --> 00:17:31.200
Until the last drop of your blood flows away,

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:32.540
we'll crush you.

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:36.200
Now, what'll it be?

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:40.290
You think you can wage war against
this many of us and still win?

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:55.290
"Griffith Rental"

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:56.620
"Exit"                     "Entrance"                   "Entrance"

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:57.950
"Exit"                     "Entrance"                   "Entrance"

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:57.950
Welco--

00:17:57.950 --> 00:17:59.290
"Exit"                     "Entrance"                   "Entrance"

00:17:57.950 --> 00:17:59.290
I need to borrow this shop for a bit.

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:01.040
I need to borrow this shop for a bit.

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:05.120
Uh, hey...

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:08.120
Okay, cut!

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:10.870
Additional Scene 25A, check!

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:14.290
Way to go, King! Somber! Smooth!

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:16.290
That performance was top-notch!

00:18:16.290 --> 00:18:17.160
--Can I get a monitor check?

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:17.790
--What about this is so difficult?
--Can I get a monitor check?

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:19.330
--What about this is so difficult?
--Sure, sure!

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:22.080
Well, you signed on easily enough.

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:24.870
Didn't you come here to be my bodyguard?

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:28.000
And the director got so into it,
he rewrote the script.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:32.870
If you think this is hard, that's proof
that you're pretending to be nice.

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:34.120
And you're vain.

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:34.790
Wha...

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:36.620
"Customers under age 18
are not allowed to enter."
I'm using the back room.

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:39.040
"Customers under age 18
are not allowed to enter."
Sure, go right ahead.

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:42.370
Will that gang of five really show up?

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:46.120
There's no need to track
them down. They'll be here.

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:48.250
I heard from Saru.

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:50.830
He says Mars tossed them aside.

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:57.660
But when you're that fixated
on revenge, you don't give up easily.

00:18:57.660 --> 00:18:59.410
Who're you guys?!

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:07.330
I'm so sick of this mask!

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:09.200
Yamamoto.

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:11.410
Majima. Andou.

00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:13.370
This day is finally here.

00:19:13.370 --> 00:19:15.700
We're taking you both down.

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:18.620
And someday, Kyouichi Ozaki, too!

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:23.580
So, you're Takashi Andou.

00:19:25.620 --> 00:19:27.790
I've heard about you.

00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:29.830
Shadow, eh?

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:35.040
I'll take two, but you can have three.
Show me what you can do.

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:36.910
What?!

00:19:36.910 --> 00:19:38.290
Screw you!

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:51.790
Sto--

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:55.250
Wow...

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:47.080
Interesting. Where did you
pick up skills like those?

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:48.950
The streets.

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:55.830
Aha. Skills can be refined,
but sense and speed are innate.

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:59.330
You must have natural talent.

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:02.120
Awesome!

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:04.200
I got some real action on video!

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:05.660
Thanks!

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:11.250
H-Huh?

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:13.200
Takashi Andou.

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:18.370
If someday you want to work
in the underworld, drop me a line.

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:21.290
You'd probably do good work.

00:21:29.910 --> 00:21:35.250
After that, the movie was completed,
and it did quite well.

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:37.620
I hear it's going to be
submitted to a film festival.

00:21:37.620 --> 00:21:42.950
"Camera, Don't Roar!!"

00:21:37.620 --> 00:21:42.950
Seems that next, he's planning a
new movie with lots of gun action.

00:21:42.950 --> 00:21:46.700
Toshiaki might not look it, but he's dedicated.

00:21:47.120 --> 00:21:48.870
"East Ikebukuro Central Park"

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:54.200
In this town, those with dedication are strong.

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:03.200
And so, there was a subtle shift
in Ikebukuro's gray zones.

00:22:03.200 --> 00:22:08.500
Thanks to this case, the Red Angels
became a more prominent presence.

00:22:08.500 --> 00:22:09.660
"Majima Produce"

00:22:08.500 --> 00:22:09.660
Well, all I can really do is sell fruit,

00:22:09.660 --> 00:22:14.540
Well, all I can really do is sell fruit,

00:22:14.540 --> 00:22:17.660
but I'll just have to be
as dedicated as I can be.

00:22:17.660 --> 00:22:19.200
In all that I do.
